  "worked_solution": "The third term is represented by $f(3).$\n\nTo compute $f(3),$ we substitute $n=1$ into the recursive formula, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(1+2) & =f(1+1)+f(1) \\\\ f(3) & =f(2)+f(1) \\\\ f(3) & =(-1)+(-2) \\\\ f(3) & =-3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the third term of the sequence is $f(3)=-3.$",
